# The unstaffed-industry line (STATE.md: "commerce without staffing", the
# Step064 side effect). Three workshops bought on day 0 for 75$ on cells that
# already touch a road: the colony has 10 workers for 5 farms + 5 wells, so all
# three idle. Under the shipped rule they still earn their 2/tick connection
# floor AND they still cost the air: Step083 superseded Step064's staffing gate,
# because free revenue with no labour and no emission was the park's counterweight
# removed (see environment.ts). Measured 2026-11-20: pollution 100 by t=90,
# admission frozen, verdict CRITICAL at t=300 with money +4/tick — i.e. this
# line is the measured counter-example, not a bug. It is deliberately NOT in
# `check-scenarios`; if you want it gated, assert `critical`.
#
# Run: node tools/agent/run.mjs --json --quiet \
#        --script tools/agent/scenarios/idle-industry.jsonl
